{
  "slug": "flexcompute",
  "name": "Flexcompute",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Flexcompute plugins bring Tidy3D and PhotonForge into your AI coding assistant. Adds the tidy3d-mcp server (live Flexcompute documentation search/fetch) plus skills that guide agents through Tidy3D simulation authoring (geometry, physics guardrails, cost checks, result analysis) and PhotonForge layout work (PCells, ports, routing, LVS-style and overlap checks). Works with Claude Code, Codex, and GitHub Copilot CLI.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install flexcompute@claude-community` from `flexcompute/plugin-marketplace`.\n\nInstall Flexcompute plugins for AI coding assistants. Use the section for your assistant below.\n\nFlexcompute plugins bring Tidy3D and PhotonForge into your AI coding assistant. Adds the tidy3d-mcp server (live Flexcompute documentation search/fetch) plus skills that guide agents through Tidy3D simulation authoring (geometry, physics guardrails, cost checks, result analysis) and PhotonForge layout work (PCells, ports, routing, LVS-style and overlap checks). Works with Claude Code, Codex, and GitHub Copilot CLI.",
